{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>OpenAI 正把 ChatGPT dot 的存取範圍擴展至 iMessage 及 RCS。此前這項主動式代理功能只限在 ChatGPT 的體驗內使用，涵蓋手機、桌面及網頁版本，用戶必須開啟 ChatGPT 主應用程式，才能與自己的 dot 互動。ChatGPT 在社交平台的帖文表示，這次擴展是回應大量用戶要求，用戶現在可以直接傳短訊給自己的 dot。</p>\n<h2>以文字照片或語音下達任務</h2>\n<p>在新安排下，用戶可以在短訊中給 dot 一項任務，讓它分擔手上的工作，或請它持續留意某件事，輸入方式包括文字、照片，甚至語音訊息。dot 亦會主動傳短訊，回報相關更新。帖文強調，經 iMessage 或 RCS 傳送的短訊安全穩妥；功能開放後，用戶可直接在「訊息」應用程式內與 dot 互動。</p>\n<h2>設定步驟與共用的上下文</h2>\n<p>設定方法是點按 dot 的個人檔案，然後選擇「Texting」。無論用戶從哪個途徑接觸 dot，它都擁有相同的上下文與外掛。帖文同時說明，這項安排不會讓 dot 或 OpenAI 取得用戶其他短訊對話的存取權。</p>\n<h2>或可經 Apple Watch 使用</h2>\n<p>把功能擴展至短訊，理論上有助讓 ChatGPT dot 以官方途徑登陸 Apple Watch，但仍需實測才能確定。這項改動亦可能開拓新的語音使用方式，超出目前內建的模擬「通話」能力。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"與 ChatGPT 相關的圖片\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"634\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/chatgpt-1.webp\" width=\"1131\"/></figure>\n<figure>\n<blockquote><p>By popular request, you can now text your dot.<br/><br/>Give it a task to take off your plate or something to keep an eye on, using text, photos, or even voice notes. It will text you proactively with relevant updates.<br/><br/>Safe, secure texting via iMessage or RCS. You’re the only one who… <a href=\"https://t.co/iuNd3aTCYc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">pic.twitter.com/iuNd3aTCYc</a></p>— ChatGPT (@ChatGPT) <a href=\"https://x.com/ChatGPT/status/2115496387613786374?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">October 28, 2026</a></blockquote>\n</figure>\n<figure>\n<blockquote><p>To set it up, tap on your dot’s profile and select ‘Texting’. Your dot has the same context and plugins, wherever you reach it. This doesn’t give your dot or OpenAI access to your other text conversations.<br/><br/>AI is most useful when it works with tools you already use and shows up…</p>— ChatGPT (@ChatGPT) <a href=\"https://x.com/ChatGPT/status/2115497827845476525?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">October 28, 2026</a></blockquote>\n</figure>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T18:41:48.745093+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1226,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T18:26:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T23:58:29.976294+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T18:39:08.905686+00:00","content_hash":"bfe71f451896385e55deb04b38ab1aaeb8aad371eb67dae54924405404a111e0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}